rooms_desc ({"This is the living room of Nokey , there's a fireplace in the east walland a nice couch in the middle. On the western side there are severalguitars hung up on the wall and a big Marshall amplifier stands thereon the floor.","This is the kitchen of Nokey. A variety of nice smells of foods stilllinger in the air, but the dishes of last night are still on the sink.It seems that he does his dishes before cooking and not after eatingdinner. There is a door to the west leading into the garden.","You have stepped into what you guess must be the garden, but looks more likean open place in some wild forest. The grass in which you standcomes up to your knees.To the north is a patch of trees, further west you can see a pond and to thesouth the grasslands continue.","This is the hallway, there are doors leading to several other rooms.South is the bedroom, north is a closet, west is the kitchenand east is the workroom.","This bedroom is as big a mess as the workroom! There is a big bed in japanesestyle in the center of the room and the walls are decorated with souvenirsand a frame with a piece of paper, a photograph and a yellow card in it.There is a large window in the south wall overlooking the Holy Missionand to the east is the bathroom.","This is a closet, you can keep things here until you need them later.","What a mess! The desk that stands here is covered with all sorts of thingsranging from pieces of metal to microprocessor chips!This is obviously a workroom, but you can hardly walk two steps withouttripping over something! There are parts of computers, guitars, bookswires and a lot of other things strewn about. Does this guy EVER tidy up?","A brightly lit bathroom. The light comes from several halogen spotlightsin the ceiling. There is a whirlpool , a toilet and a sink here, all made ofwhite porcelain.It is very clean and tidy compared to all the other rooms you've seen inthis house!","This is a piece of the garden where there are many trees, they arepacked together so closely that hardly any sunlight can get to the ground.The almost absense of sunlight makes the vegetation on the ground verysparse. It is mostly covered with dead leaves, giving the air the smell ofa real forest.","You are swimming in a pond. Although the water is quite nice and warm,it is very clear. The warm water soaks the stress out of your body.This is very nice, you feel relaxed and decide to stay here for a while.",})
